  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Thinly slice the cabbage with a sharp knife or mandoline. Shred the carrot using a julienne peeler or coarsely grate with a box grater. Thinly slice the celery and spring onion. Crush or finely chop 1 garlic clove.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2807152/photos/large/172062_1-f41fa477d157fea2f8d96505e1388122.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make slaw: Combine 1 tbs mayonnaise and 2 tsp red wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the cabbage, carrot, celery and spring onion and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2807153/photos/large/172062_2-daf1d586fdca1a85bbd05c1301e2bc88.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Brown mushroom meat: Heat 2 tsp olive oil in a medium frypan over high heat. Cook the mushroom meat, breaking up the lumps with a spoon, for 3 mins or until starting to brown. Add the garlic and cook, stirring, for 1 min or until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2807154/photos/large/172062_3-dc9b1ae3f67fc1b1aa5c0c29352356ff.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add seasoning: Add the Tex-Mex seasoning and 1½ tbs water to the mushroom meat and cook, stirring, for 3 mins or until browned. Remove the pan from the heat. Taste, then season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2807155/photos/large/172062_4-c2f47f4e4204dcac7ac1826a3d3a6fb9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Put the tortillas on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through (see Make it yours). Divide the tortillas among plates. Fill with the mushroom meat and slaw and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2807156/photos/large/172062_5-5abd2c549fd8defa6259cbf7024735f8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: Don't have a microwave? Enclose the tortillas in foil, then put in a 220C oven for 8 mins or until softened and warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/2807157/photos/large/172062_6-06927a3c6dfe55e259b2474ece191439.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
